## 4. Key Workflows

### A. Authentication & Verification
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend (Auth API)
  participant MongoDB
  participant Mailer (SMTP/Gmail)

  User->>Frontend: Enter credentials
  Frontend->>Backend (Auth API): POST /api/auth/register
  Backend (Auth API)->>MongoDB: Save unverified user + OTP
  Backend (Auth API)->>Mailer: Send verification OTP email
  Backend (Auth API)-->>Frontend: Response (requires OTP verification)
  Frontend->>Frontend: Redirect to /verify-otp
  User->>Frontend: Enter OTP code
  Frontend->>Backend (Auth API): POST /api/auth/verify-otp
  Backend (Auth API)->>MongoDB: Update user.isVerified = true
  Backend (Auth API)-->>Frontend: Auth Token (JWT)
```

### B. Campaign Send & In-Flight Tracking
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend (Campaign API)
  participant Queue (Redis/BullMQ)
  participant Worker (Background Proc)
  participant Recipient (Mail Client)

  User->>Frontend: Click "Send Campaign"
  Frontend->>Backend (Campaign API): POST /api/campaign/send/:id
  Backend (Campaign API)->>MongoDB: Create EmailLogs (state: queued)
  Backend (Campaign API)->>Queue (Redis/BullMQ): Add jobs for each recipient
  Backend (Campaign API)-->>Frontend: Respond "Campaign processing"
  
  loop Process Queue Jobs
    Worker (Background Proc)->>Queue (Redis/BullMQ): Pull job
    Worker (Background Proc)->>MongoDB: Fetch campaign & contact details
    Worker (Background Proc)->>Worker (Background Proc): Replace placeholders + inject 1x1 Tracking Pixel
    Worker (Background Proc)->>Recipient (Mail Client): Deliver email
    Worker (Background Proc)->>MongoDB: Update EmailLog (sent) & Campaign stats
  end
```

